

pc072_mib_tongue2

Version = A
Subversion = 21

This file describes PCB fabrication details for the
uTCA tongue-2 daughterboard for the MIB v3
for the DUNE timing system
 
contact:	David.Cussans@bristol.ac.uk
		tel: 0117 95 46879
		     0117 33 17199
		fax: 0117 925 5624


Files produced by Cadence Allegro PE24.1

Artwork:
--------

Format: Gerber RS-274X , parameters described in art_param.txt. 
All layers viewed from top

Build:
------

6-layer build 

Hard gold plating on edge connector fingers at left hand side of board 

Any suitable finish ( e.g. ENIG ) to other pads

Layers as follows:

03_TOP.art
04_GND.art
05_SIG.art
06_SIG.art
07_GND.art
08_BOTTOM.art


Fabrication:
------------
11_FABRICATION.art

Including details of bevelling board edge connector

Hard Gold:
----------

Location indicated by

12_HARDGOLD_TOP.art
13_HARDGOLD_BOTT.art
  
  
Solder Masks
------------

02_SOLDERMASKTOP.art
09_SOLDERMASKBOTT.art

Colour - green. 

Solderpaste mask 
-----------------

Derive from pads / soldermask

Silk screen
-----------

01_SILKTOP.art
10_SILKBOTT.art


Colour - white.

Board outline: (Gerber RS-274X)
-------------------------------

00_OUTLINE.art


